  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>整星信息总线的只读工程遥测观察器</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.EngineeringTelemetryObserver</code>　<b>类型：</b>model</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>整星信息总线的只读工程遥测观察器</p><h3>在工程中使用</h3><p>当前直接使用位置：<a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Systems.Four_systems.InformationOverall\">OneSatSim.Systems.Four_systems.InformationOverall</a> 的 <code>engineeringTelemetryObserver</code>。</p><h3>接口、输入与输出</h3><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>名称/维数</th><th>类型</th><th>声明角色</th><th>单位</th><th>含义</th></tr><tr><td><code>live</code></td><td>OneSatSim.Foundation.Interfaces.InformationPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 live</td></tr><tr><td><code>telemetry</code></td><td>OneSatSim.Foundation.Interfaces.OnboardTelemetryPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>只读遥测信息接口</td></tr><tr><td><code>SOLAR_netDeliveredPower_WPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>SOLARnetDelivered功率WPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>POWER_threeRailOutputPower_WPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>功率threeRail输出功率WPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>BMS_chargeAllowedPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.BooleanOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 BMS_chargeAllowedPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>THERM_transmitter_degCPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 THERM_transmitter_degCPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>ATT_starY_validPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.BooleanOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 ATT_starY_validPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>DATA_storedBytesPublisher</code></td><td>Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>数据storedBytesPublisher</td></tr><tr><td><code>DATA_acceptedWriteRate_B_sPublisher</code></td><td>Modelic